dex":27,"source_sha256":"3b7b9cecfc5d5d18dd7f180120796d0ea3a236a86bda28ab1f8d19191751cc61","speaker":"Calvin","turn_index":1}],"speaker":null,"store_id":"s3","store_snapshot_sha256":"983238fddc77a88ef4ae3d06b50bcfd25a429f497e89c6af4d9477cefca9cad2","text":"- On 2023-10-23, thanked Dave for his support — \"Thanks Dave! Appreciate your support!\" [S25T24].\n- On 2023-10-23, in the closing exchange about concerts: music \"brings us together and creates unforgettable memories,\" and it's \"unbeatable in terms of the energy it brings\"; he called concerts what he lives for — \"the indescribable connection between the artist and the crowd is just amazing!\" — and the rush of connecting with everyone at a concert is a feeling that's \"unbeatable\" (complements his 2023-05-31 \"fuels my soul\" remark above; Dave's side in the Music section of /memories/dave.md) [S25T26][S25T28][S25T30].\n- On 2023-10-25, when Dave asked what got him into engineering cars, Calvin said he's \"totally into cars too and love[s] making new and powerful models\" (his own interest in making cars — complements the orange car project he relaxes on, see above, and his finding that working on cars relaxes him \"like meditation\"); seeing Dave work on cars is \"inspiring - it makes me want to keep pushing my music\" (his love of cars also noted in the 2023-10-25 entry of ## Relationships) [S26T5].\n- On 2023-10-25, shared a photo of himself performing at a nightclub (a DJ at a DJ table in a nightclub) with someone he admires — \"So amazing!\" (Dave: \"You looked super comfortable on stage. Bet it was an incredible experience to perform with someone you admire. How did it feel being up there?\") (Dave's side in the Relationships section of /memories/dave.md) [S26T7][S26T8]. Calvin: performing \"with someone I admire\" was \"unreal\" — \"a dream come true\" — and the energy and the crowd made him realize how much music means to him — \"it's like my passion and my purpose\" (complements his long-stated \"fuels my soul\"/concerts-are-what-he-lives-for remarks above; closing exchange details in the 2023-10-25 entry of ## Relationships) [S26T9].\n- On 2023-10-29, told Dave that since they last talked he went to a networking event to meet more artists — \"so cool!\" — and that the people he met will help him build up his fan base — \"super excited about what it could lead to.\" (an active step in his plan to expand his brand and grow his fanbase — see the 2023-08-03 entry above; Dave's side in the Relationships section of /memories/dave.md) [S27T1].","text_sha256":"4242dc610a50673009b8b27c2db3184095485974839bef0f2ea5a14b3c309624","timestamp":null},{"attribution_index_sha256":"98109144a5a23da7a5b89634be2c543ea2366f2abe85f1f3f8a3df64a5e92ce2","attribution_units":[{"dia_ids":["D3:12","D3:13"],"kind":"curated_fact","line_end":12,"line_start":12,"source_locators":["[S3T12]","[S3T13]"],"text_sha256":"ca4e86ad300a12708587de82ee20badb6043b29c7b43f431e28c454b16c774e4"},{"dia_ids":["D3:12"],"kind":"curated_fact","line_end":13,"line_start":13,"source_locators":["[S3T12]"],"text_sha256":"1dee28f8e442efa1196455117ca4d94ad502147d88d3c2da6887c42f494c842a"},{"dia_ids":["D4:5","D4:7"],"kind":"curated_fact","line_end":14,"line_start":14,"source_locators":["[S4T5]","[S4T7]"],"text_sha256":"beca758c22506a8a978dd40011317b812dcd28ec7d57c79934515b8e25e173d3"},{"dia_ids":["D4:7"],"kind":"curated_fact","line_end":15,"line_start":15,"source_locators":["[S4T7]"],"text_sha256":"cee01ce94c2cada82fe6d0ced651663349360e643d0f0af4ab37c97818e0f356"},{"dia_ids":["D5:5"],"kind":"curated_fact","line_end":16,"line_start":16,"source_locators":["[S5T5]"],"text_sha256":"244be699a041a664dbaa00e7561e58356a1fc4a0dc9886926d4eda9e1ca1206e"}],"dia_ids":["D3:12","D3:13","D4:5","D4:7","D5:5"],"evidence_id":"ev-947992210942f0556e37fb922e54774e427dcf6ace043667e84c0477ca97cff8","group_id":"/memories/dave.md > # Dave","line_end":16,"line_start":12,"observation_ids":["obs-0001"],"path":"/memories/dave.md","query_terms":["d